   <li><a href=\"wool\">Wool<\/a><\/li>\n          <li><a href=\"silk\">Silk<\/a><\/li>\n          <li><a href=\"Viscose\">Bamboo Silk\/Viscose<\/a><\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n      <\/div>\n\n    <\/aside>\n    <!-- RIGHT CONTENT -->\n    <div class=\"know-rug-content\">\n\n      <div class=\"know-rug-heading\">\n        <h1 id=\"hand-knotted\">Viscose<\/h1>\n      <\/div>\n<div class=\"content-block\">\n        <h2>The Weaving Process<\/h2>\n\n        <p>\n          Hand-knotting found its way into Indian heritage from Persia, giving it its name Persian Hand-knotting. It’s uniqueness in art is through its style of printing; knot by knot and line by line, paying attention to each intricate detail.\n        <\/p>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"hero-image\">\n        <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0648\/2188\/7176\/files\/GENERATE_A_BANNER_OF_THIS_202606171651_1.jpg?v=1781695397\">\n      <\/div>\n\n      <p>\n          Hand-knotting found its way into Indian heritage from Persia, giving it its name Persian Hand-knotting. It’s uniqueness in art is through its style of printing; knot by knot and line by line, paying attention to each intricate detail.\n        <\/p>\n<div class=\"content-block\">\n\n        <div class=\"identify-grid-benefits\">\n\n          <div class=\"identify-card-n\">\n            <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0648\/2188\/7176\/files\/ideal-space-icon.png?v=1781786070\">\n            <h5>Durable<\/h5>\n          <\/div>\n\n          <div class=\"identify-card-n\">\n            <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0648\/2188\/7176\/files\/ideal-space-icon.png?v=1781786070\">\n            <h5>Timeless<\/h5>          \n          <\/div>\n\n          <div class=\"identify-card-n\">\n            <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0648\/2188\/7176\/files\/ideal-space-icon.png?v=1781786070\">\n            <h5>Unique<\/h5>\n          <\/div>\n\n\n        <\/div>\n <p>\n          Hand-knotting found its way into Indian heritage from Persia, giving it its name Persian Hand-knotting. It’s uniqueness in art is through its style of printing; knot by knot and line by line, paying attention to each intricate detail.\n        <\/p>\n     \n\n      <div class=\"content-block\">\n\n        <h2>Why Choose Wool?<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Most high-quality wool is strong and durable, while still being soft to the touch.<\/li>\n<li>Resistant to water, dirt and stains, so it is easier to maintain than other materials.<\/li>\n<li>Absorbs moisture and dries out without developing mold or mildew – ideal in humid climates.<\/li>\n<li>Easy to dye and holds color well.<\/li>\n<li>It is an elastic fiber, so the marks from foot traffic can be easily brushed out.<\/li>\n<li>An excellent insulator.<\/li>\n<li>As a natural fiber, harvesting wool is more eco-friendly than synthetic fibers.<\/li>\n<li>Great at hiding dirt and looks cleaner and better for longer than other fibers.<\/li><\/ul>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"content-block\">\n\n        <h2>Other Considerations\n<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Wool is comparatively more expensive than many other fibers.\n<\/li>\n<li>Some people are allergic to wool.<\/li>\n<li>New wool rugs shed loose fibers for the first few months of use.<\/li>\n<li>Care must be taken when storing wool rugs to prevent them from being eaten by moths.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n      <\/div>\n      \n      <\/div>\n <div class=\"rug-buttons\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"rug-btn\">Shop Now<\/a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"rug-btn secondary\">Rug Care<\/a>\n        <\/div>\n \n    <\/div>\n\n  <\/div>\n\n<\/section>","color_scheme":"","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}}},"order":["main","image_banner_yM9aXM","custom_liquid_ehC3aN"]}